# Wav2Lip lip-sync (Phase 3)
# Set LIP_SYNC_ENABLED=1 and point WAV2LIP_DIR + WAV2LIP_CHECKPOINT at a local
# clone of https://github.com/Rudrabha/Wav2Lip and a downloaded GAN checkpoint
# (wav2lip_gan.pth). When enabled but unconfigured, lip-sync silently disables
# unless LIP_SYNC_STRICT=1.
